              <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">VIII.</div>
            </td>
            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
              <div style="text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><u>CLAIMS PROCEDURES</u></div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
    </div>
